</div>
<div id="u-credit-00148-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4888797); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4888797&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605988655" alt="WOrs Obrine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4888797)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4888797); return false;">WOrs Obrine</a></span></p>
